# Tile localIndex is always 0-based

Every atlas `localIndex` in this repo is **0-based**. `0` is the top-left cell:

`localIndex = row * columns + col`

Use the same numbers as collision maps in `src/config/tilesets.ts`. Do not add 1. Do not treat spreadsheet labels (A1, B6, G11) as indices. If a designer lists 35, 47, 59, 71, those are the localIndex values.
